y releases such as \, "rdquo" -> In My Skin" and creative mashups like \, "
 
rdquo" -> I Got 5 On It" helped build his audience. His debut album\, Turni
 
n Into Something\, produced in collaboration with Murda Beatz\, showcases h
 
is evolution as an artist and blends his diverse musical influence. Notable
 
 tracks include \, "rdquo" -> Cigarettes\," \, "rdquo" -> Somethin Bout You
 
\," and \, "rdquo" -> Let You Go\," which highlight his ability to translat
 
